            <ArticleTitle>Quantitative coronary angiography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>125-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>While the value of the quantitation of image data often appears to be self evident, it is important to consider the use to which it is to be put before adopting one particular approach. The importance of this concept is illustrated by reference to coronary angiography.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
